  "solution": "Given: \n\n26 A 12 A 12 A 6 A 2 A 5 A 6\n\nBy checking the options:\n\n1. -, +, ÷, =, ×, +\n\n⇒ 26 - 12 + **__12 ÷ 6__** = 2 × 5 + 6\n\n⇒ **__26 __**- 12 **__+ 2__ **= **__2 × 5__** + 6\n\n⇒ **__28 - 12__** = **__10 + 6__**\n\n⇒ 16 = 16\n\n2. +, -, ÷, ×, =, +\n\n⇒ 26 + 12 - **__12 ÷ 6__** × 2 = 5 + 6\n\n⇒ 26 + 12 - **__2 ×__****__ 2__** = **__5__****__ + 6__**\n\n⇒ **__26 + 12__** - 4 = 11\n\n⇒ 38 - 4 = 11\n\n⇒ **34 ****≠ 11**\n\n3. -, +, ×, =, ÷, +\n\n⇒ 26 - 12 + **__12 × 6__** = **__2 ÷ 5__** + 6\n\n⇒ **__26 __**- 12 **__+ 72__** = **__0.4 + 6__**\n\n⇒ **__98 - 12 __**= 6.4\n\n⇒ **86** ≠ 6.4\n\n 4. -, +, ÷, ×, =, + \n\n⇒ 26 - 12 +** __12 ÷ 6__** × 2 =** __5 + 6__**\n\n⇒ 26 - 12 +** __2 ×__****__ 2__** = 11\n\n⇒ __**26 **__- 12 __**+ 4**__ = 11\n\n⇒ **__30 - 12__** = 11\n\n⇒** 18 ****≠ 11**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"option (1)\".",
